+### NeuRBF
+A hybrid neural field model that enhances representation accuracy and compactness by combining adaptive radial basis functions (RBFs) with grid-based RBF interpolation [S6]. Introduce multi-frequency sinusoidal composition to extend the frequencies encoded by each basis function [S6]. Decode these features by an MLP for volume rendering with SDF reconstruction capabilities [S6].
 
